{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.HabiroTailAction","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_3_bar_odd_term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_3_bar_odd_term","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L139-L144","doc":"**The third `5_2` bar-odd Habiro term** — the odd-locus on the authoritative\nMasbaum `C_{5_2,3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_2_bar_odd_term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_2_bar_odd_term","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L131-L137","doc":"**The second `5_2` bar-odd Habiro term** is the coefficient's bar-asymmetry\ntimes the (bar-even) factor — the odd-locus on the authoritative Masbaum\n`C_{5_2,2}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1_asymmetry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1_asymmetry","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L122-L129","doc":"The explicit bar-asymmetry of the leading `5_2` coefficient:\n`C_{5_2,1}(t) - C_{5_2,1}(t^{-1}) = t^4 + t^2 - t^{-2} - t^{-4}` (for `t ≠ 0`),\na nonzero Laurent polynomial — chirality made explicit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1_bar_odd_term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1_bar_odd_term","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L115-L120","doc":"**The leading `5_2` bar-odd Habiro term** is the coefficient's bar-asymmetry\ntimes the (bar-even) factor — the odd-locus, instantiated on the real `5_2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_3","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L108-L113","doc":"Third `5_2` cyclotomic coefficient\n`C_{5_2,3}(t) = -(t^{-9}+t^{-11}+t^{-12}+t^{-13}+t^{-15}+t^{-16}+t^{-17}+t^{-21})`\n(Masbaum `C_{5_2,3}(q) = -(q⁹+q¹¹+q¹²+q¹³+q¹⁵+q¹⁶+q¹⁷+q²¹)` at `t = q^{-1}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_2","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L103-L106","doc":"Second `5_2` cyclotomic coefficient `C_{5_2,2}(t) = t^{-5}+t^{-7}+t^{-8}+t^{-11}`\n(Masbaum `C_{5_2,2}(q) = q⁵+q⁷+q⁸+q¹¹` at `t = q^{-1}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.c52_1","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L99-L101","doc":"Leading `5_2` cyclotomic coefficient `C_{5_2,1}(t) = -(t^{-2} + t^{-4})`\n(Masbaum `C_{5_2,1}(q) = -(q⁴+q²)` at `t = q^{-1}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.fourOne_habiroTerm_bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.fourOne_habiroTerm_bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L61-L65","doc":"**`4_1` case: the constant coefficient `C ≡ 1` gives a bar-even term.**\nThe `4_1` Habiro tail (`C_n = 1`) carries no bar-odd datum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.habiroTerm_bar_even_of_coeff_symmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.habiroTerm_bar_even_of_coeff_symmetric","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L50-L59","doc":"**Bar-symmetric coefficient ⇒ bar-even term.** If `C q = C q⁻¹` (the `4_1`\ncase `C = 1` in particular), the `n`-th Habiro term is `q ↔ q⁻¹` invariant:\nno bar-odd datum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.habiroTerm_bar_odd_eq_coeff_asymmetry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.habiroTerm_bar_odd_eq_coeff_asymmetry","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HabiroCyclotomicOddLocus.lean#L38-L48","doc":"**Odd-locus identity.** With a general cyclotomic coefficient `C : ℝ → ℝ`\n(the value `C_{K,n}` as a function of `q`), the bar-odd (`q ↔ q⁻¹`\nantisymmetric) part of the `n`-th Habiro term is exactly the bar-asymmetry\nof the coefficient times the (bar-even) factor:\n\n  `C q · f_j(q) − C q⁻¹ · f_j(q⁻¹) = (C q − C q⁻¹) · f_j(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}